  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Drainage, Irrigation &amp; Wetlands Improvement Project - Phase 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.To  increase the productivity of irrigated agriculture, employment and incomes  in Karakalpakstan, one of the poorest regions in Central Asia.  2. To improve water quality of the Amu Darya river by safe disposal of the drainage effluent, and  enhance quality of wetlands in the Amu Darya delta. 3. To develop the institutions for improving water management, operation and maintenance (O&amp;M) of the irrigation and drainage systems, and for promoting sustainable irrigated agriculture through participatory irrigation management.</narrative>
  </description>
